{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:44 2026-11-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:44 2026-11-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:44 2026-11-18 HKT</p><img alt=\"JW王灝兒秘婚後首度孖老公王至尊公開現身 捧衛蘭紅館尾場大方企定定合照 。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl_square/f28a087cb92a56989a77e377674bf2ea/2026-11/cats1_82.jpg\"/><p>衛蘭的《JANICE VIDAL 衛蘭 OUT OF FRAME 世界巡迴演唱會－香港站》一共四場在紅館舉行，今晚進行尾場演出，並吸引到陳明憙、關心妍、丁子高和太太楊千嬅、AGA（江海迦）與未婚夫鄭子邦及林盛斌等入場睇騷外，還有早前被《東周刊》獨家披露去年11月秘婚的王灝兒（JW）與老公王至尊也孖住到場，更大方企定定合照。</p><img alt=\"關心妍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3566c2127fee48e8781fc9a01d443055/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_21_28_45_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"楊千嬅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/162151721283b52166a7864d6afd2650/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_21_28_46_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"千嬅和丁子高被AGA（江海迦）隔開，AGA未婚夫鄭子邦(左)。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5ac25fac1bdd26db41eb076fe47e323a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_21_28_46_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"幸福阿太JW。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a71901793b91da64cbe2eb427f0716c8/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_21_28_47_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"笑得燦爛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5a33c8dd6a951bb10bedd84772d91ef0/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_21_28_47_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"拉住老公王至尊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f91fbea627306b901a45da1b4c3c9e7c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_21_28_47_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"兩公婆終大方合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f56162bece5fb06ff9fcec0643bee213/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_21_28_47_4_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"仲有阿Bob。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c36903f053da8d237b2ad883ed93a699/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_21_29_39.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:15:39.791123+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":245,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13